  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA rectangular carton of orange juice has dimensions 14.2 cm \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20358\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 13.8 cm \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20359\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/times.gif\"\u003e 12.5 cm. A cylindrical bottle of orange juice from another company holds one half gallon. If both are the same price and quality, which one should you buy?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
  "statementFigure": null,
  "question": null,
  "widgetSlot": null,
  "steps": [
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eMultiply to find the volume of the rectangular carton.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eMultiply to find the volume of the rectangular carton.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eKey in \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20360\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20361\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q4.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20362\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qdot.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20362\u0026quot;,135)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20363\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20364\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qtimes.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20364\u0026quot;,238)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20365\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20366\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q3.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20367\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qdot.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20367\u0026quot;,135)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20368\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q8.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20369\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qtimes.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20369\u0026quot;,238)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20370\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20371\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20372\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qdot.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20372\u0026quot;,135)\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20373\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q5.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20374\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20374\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThe calculator gives the volume as 2449.5 cm\u003csup\u003e3\u003c/sup\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-1 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_8_80/f-80-8-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eConvert to gallons.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20375\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2nd.gif\"\u003e\u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20376\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qconvert.gif\"\u003e and select \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20377\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q3.gif\"\u003e for Volume. Then press \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20378\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q6.gif\"\u003e for cm\u003csup\u003e3\u003c/sup\u003e, followed by \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20379\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e for gallons.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-3 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_8_80/f-80-8-2.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "hint",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20380\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20380\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e",
      "figure": null,
      "figures": null
    },
    {
      "role": "step",
      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_20381\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_20381\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e. The calculator gives the converted value as approximately 0.647 gallons.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003eThis is greater than a half gallon. So, you should buy the rectangular carton.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-5 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_9_1_areasandvolumes_8_80/f-80-8-3.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
